{"seq":2,"slug":"worker-debugging","title":"调试与可观测：跨线程的错误与埋点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-debugging","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"调试与可观测-跨线程的错误与埋点\">调试与可观测：跨线程的错误与埋点</h1><p>Worker 里抛了个异常，主线程的 <code>window.onerror</code> 却一片寂静；线上用户报「点了没反应」，你打开监控却看不到 Worker 内部发生了什么。隔离模型带来的并发能力，反面就是「另一根线程是个黑盒」。这一篇讲怎么把这个黑盒打开：在 DevTools 里断点 Worker、捕获并上报跨线程错误、给 Worker 加埋点观测它的耗时与队列深度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Worker 的可观测难点全部源自隔离：它有独立的执行上下文、独立的调用栈、独立的错误传播路径。主线程的错误处理器收不到 Worker 的异常，主线程的断点也停不到 Worker 的代码。要观测它，必须用 Worker 专属的入口——它自己的 <code>onerror</code>、它和主线程之间的消息通道、以及 DevTools 里单独列出的 Worker 线程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Worker 内未捕获异常] --&gt; B[worker.onerror 事件&lt;br/&gt;含 message/filename/lineno]&#10;  C[消息反序列化失败] --&gt; D[messageerror 事件]&#10;  B --&gt; E[主线程统一上报]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  F[Worker 内 performance.now 埋点] --&gt; G[随结果 postMessage 回传]&#10;  G --&gt; H[主线程聚合&lt;br/&gt;耗时/队列深度指标]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Worker 内未捕获异常] --&gt; B[worker.onerror 事件&lt;br/&gt;含 message/filename/lineno]\n  C[消息反序列化失败] --&gt; D[messageerror 事件]\n  B --&gt; E[主线程统一上报]\n  D --&gt; E\n  F[Worker 内 performance.now 埋点] --&gt; G[随结果 postMessage 回传]\n  G --&gt; H[主线程聚合&lt;br/&gt;耗时/队列深度指标]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测需求</th>\n<th>入口</th>\n<th>注意点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步异常</td>\n<td><code>worker.onerror</code></td>\n<td>不冒泡到 window.onerror</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步未捕获 reject</td>\n<td>Worker 内 <code>self.onunhandledrejection</code></td>\n<td>需在 Worker 内监听</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息反序列化失败</td>\n<td><code>worker.onmessageerror</code></td>\n<td>传了不可克隆的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点调试</td>\n<td>DevTools 线程下拉</td>\n<td>Worker 单独列出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耗时/队列指标</td>\n<td>自埋点 + 回传</td>\n<td>主线程聚合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"在-devtools-里调试-worker\">在 DevTools 里调试 Worker</h2><p>Chrome DevTools 把每根 Worker 当作独立的执行上下文。打开 Sources 面板，左侧的线程区会列出主线程之外的每根 Worker；选中某根，就能在它的源码里下断点、单步、看作用域里的变量——和调试主线程脚本体验一致。Console 面板顶部的上下文下拉框也能切到某根 Worker，让你在它的作用域里执行表达式。</p>\n<p>模块 Worker（<code>type: &#39;module&#39;</code>）配合 sourcemap 后，断点能落到原始 TypeScript 而非编译产物，这依赖打包时正确生成并关联 Worker 的 sourcemap。一个实用技巧是在 Worker 入口顶部加 <code>debugger</code> 语句，避免 Worker 启动太快、还没来得及手动下断点就跑完了。<code>console.log</code> 在 Worker 里照常可用，输出会带上来源标注汇入主 Console。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨线程错误捕获与上报\">跨线程错误捕获与上报</h2><p>生产环境看不到 DevTools，必须主动捕获错误并上报。Worker 的错误有三条独立通道，缺一不可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const worker = new Worker(/* ... */);&#10;&#10;// 1. Worker 内同步异常（含未捕获错误）&#10;worker.onerror = (e) =&gt; {&#10;  report({ kind: &#39;worker-error&#39;, message: e.message, file: e.filename, line: e.lineno });&#10;  e.preventDefault();&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 2. 主线程发了不可克隆的值，或 Worker 回传的值无法反序列化&#10;worker.onmessageerror = (e) =&gt; report({ kind: &#39;worker-messageerror&#39; });&#10;&#10;// worker.js 内部：捕获异步 reject&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;unhandledrejection&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  self.postMessage({ __error: String(e.reason) }); // 显式回传给主线程上报&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const worker = new Worker(/* ... */);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. Worker 内同步异常（含未捕获错误）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.onerror = (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  report({ kind: 'worker-error', message: e.message, file: e.filename, line: e.lineno });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  e.preventDefault();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 主线程发了不可克隆的值，或 Worker 回传的值无法反序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.onmessageerror = (e) => report({ kind: 'worker-messageerror' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// worker.js 内部：捕获异步 reject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('unhandledrejection', (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  self.postMessage({ __error: String(e.reason) }); // 显式回传给主线程上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条通道对应三类故障：<code>onerror</code> 抓同步抛出（关联 <a href=\"../communication/postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a> 之外的逻辑错误），<code>onmessageerror</code> 抓克隆/反序列化失败（典型是误传了函数或不可克隆对象，正是 <a href=\"../communication/postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a> 里讲的 <code>DataCloneError</code> 家族），Worker 内的 <code>unhandledrejection</code> 抓异步 Promise 失败——后者尤其容易漏，因为它既不冒泡也不触发 <code>onerror</code>，必须在 Worker 内部显式监听再回传。</p>\n<p>错误上报的 sourcemap 还原、堆栈解析、采样策略等整体可观测体系，归 <a href=\"../../frontend-observability/error-tracking/error-capture\">前端可观测性(15)</a>，本篇只负责把 Worker 这一层的错误「捞出来交给上报系统」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能埋点-观测-worker-的耗时与队列\">性能埋点：观测 Worker 的耗时与队列</h2><p>排查「Worker 慢」需要数据，而 Worker 内部的耗时主线程看不到，得自己埋点回传。基本套路是在 Worker 里用 <code>performance.now()</code> 框住计算段，把耗时随结果一起 post 回主线程聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// worker.js&#10;self.onmessage = (e) =&gt; {&#10;  const t0 = performance.now();&#10;  const result = doWork(e.data.payload);&#10;  self.postMessage({ id: e.data.id, result, cost: performance.now() - t0 });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// worker.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.onmessage = (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const t0 = performance.now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const result = doWork(e.data.payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  self.postMessage({ id: e.data.id, result, cost: performance.now() - t0 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>主线程侧再观测两类指标：单任务耗时分布（p50/p95，揪出长尾任务）和<a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a>的队列深度（等待中的任务数，反映背压是否在堆积）。设单 Worker 平均处理时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、池大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、平均到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，按排队论队列里平均等待任务数随利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda \\bar{t}}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2653em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9203em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高而急剧增长——当观测到队列深度持续上涨，就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的信号，说明该加池子或上背压了。这些埋点也可接入 <code>User Timing API</code>（<code>performance.mark</code>/<code>measure</code>），让 Worker 的关键阶段出现在 DevTools 的 Performance 火焰图里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱速查\">常见陷阱速查</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Worker 静默失败</strong>：忘了挂 <code>onerror</code>，异常无声无息。务必三条通道全挂。</li>\n<li><strong>断点不停</strong>：Worker 启动即跑完，来不及下断点。用 <code>debugger</code> 语句或入口处 sleep 占位。</li>\n<li><strong>sourcemap 错位</strong>：Worker 的 sourcemap 没正确生成/关联，堆栈指向编译产物。检查打包配置。</li>\n<li><strong>异步 reject 漏报</strong>：Promise 失败既不触发 <code>onerror</code> 也不冒泡，必须 Worker 内监听 <code>unhandledrejection</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>看不到队列堆积</strong>：只测单任务耗时、不测队列深度，背压问题被掩盖。两者都要测。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Worker 的可观测难点全源于隔离：独立栈、独立错误路径，主线程的 <code>onerror</code> 和断点都够不着它。</li>\n<li>DevTools 把每根 Worker 列为独立线程，可单独断点；配 sourcemap 能落到原始源码，<code>debugger</code> 语句防漏停。</li>\n<li>错误捕获需三条通道并用：<code>worker.onerror</code>（同步）、<code>onmessageerror</code>（克隆失败）、Worker 内 <code>unhandledrejection</code>（异步 reject）。</li>\n<li>性能观测靠 Worker 内 <code>performance.now()</code> 埋点回传，主线程聚合单任务耗时分布与池队列深度。</li>\n<li>队列深度持续上涨意味利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，是该扩池或加背压的信号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../communication/postmessage-structured-clone\">postMessage 与结构化克隆</a> — messageerror 的来源；<a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> — 队列深度与背压指标；<a href=\"worker-framework-integration\">框架集成</a> — 集成后的 sourcemap 配置。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../frontend-observability/error-tracking/error-capture\">前端可观测性(15) · 错误捕获</a> — 错误上报与 sourcemap 还原的整体体系；<a href=\"../../performance-optimization/foundations/measurement-and-profiling-tools\">性能优化(03) · 测量与剖析工具</a> — Performance 面板与 User Timing。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调试与可观测：跨线程的错误与埋点","id":"调试与可观测-跨线程的错误与埋点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"在 DevTools 里调试 Worker","id":"在-devtools-里调试-worker"},{"level":2,"text":"跨线程错误捕获与上报","id":"跨线程错误捕获与上报"},{"level":2,"text":"性能埋点：观测 Worker 的耗时与队列","id":"性能埋点-观测-worker-的耗时与队列"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱速查","id":"常见陷阱速查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"框架集成：让构建工具与组件认得 Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-framework-integration"},"next":{"title":"选型与边界：什么时候才真该上 Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-when-to-use"}}